OL,3,AEU chief lays out vision for new Canada
OL,4,Apartnership at Montreal summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FEuropean Commission President Ursula
OL,7,Fvon der Leyen has laid out her vision
OL,8,Ffor what an "associate membership"
OL,9,Fstatus for Canada to the EU would look
OL,10,Flike as officials gather in Montreal to
OL,11,Fdiscuss closer ties.
OL,13,FIt is "a partnership that comes close
OL,14,Fto membership than anything we have
OL,15,Fdone before," she said on Thursday's
OL,16,Fremarks at the two-day Canada-EU
OL,17,Fsummit.
OL,19,FShe added it is a type of relationship
OL,20,Fthat would be open "only to our closest
OL,21,Fpartners outside of Europe who are
OL,22,Fready to open a new frontier together."
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
